{"sha": "f2fed1977092bf3ac3d59142b8bbebfd2a5f1ac55f03e37cb837965ff7ed395a", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:charges-currents-conduction} 章 --- 电荷、电流与导电}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:charges-currents-conduction:1}", "$j = 16/2.5 \\times 10^{-6} = \\qty{6.4e6}{A/m^2}$; $v = j/ne = \\qty{0.47}{mm/s}$; \\qty{20}{m}", "所需时间 $4.3 \\times 10^4$ s，即十二小时。$E = j/\\gamma = \\qty{0.11}{V/m}$；$U = \\qty{2.1}{V}$；", "$P = UI = \\qty{34}{W}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:charges-currents-conduction:2}", "闪电 $3 \\times 10^4/\\pi10^{-4} = \\qty{1e8}{A/m^2}$；光束 $\\qty{4e3}{A/m^2}$；轴突", "$10^{-9}/1.3 \\times 10^{-11} = \\qty{80}{A/m^2}$；环电流 \\qty{1e-8}{A/m^2}。只有", "闪电超过导线的 $6 \\times 10^6$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:charges-currents-conduction:3}", "$R = \\rho_eL/S$：$0.68$、$1.1$、$4.0$、\\qty{44}{\\ohm}。铝：$2.5 \\times 2.8/1.7 =", "\\qty{4.1}{mm^2}$，质量之比 $(4.1 \\times 2700)/(2.5 \\times 8900) = 0.50$ --- 质量减半。", "加热器：$R = 230^2/1000 = \\qty{53}{\\ohm}$，$S = \\qty{0.196}{mm^2}$，$L = RS/\\rho_e = \\qty{9.4}{m}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:charges-currents-conduction:4}", "$\\tau = m\\gamma/ne^2$：铜 \\qty{2.5e-14}{s}，$\\mu = e\\tau/m = \\qty{4.4e-3}{m^2/(V.s)}$，", "$\\ell = \\qty{40}{nm}$；银 \\qty{3.8e-14}{s}，\\qty{6.7e-3}{m^2/(V.s)}，\\qty{61}{nm}。", "硅：$\\gamma = ne\\mu = 10^{22} \\times 1.6 \\times 10^{-19} \\times 0.14 = \\qty{220}{S/m}$；$v =", "\\mu E = \\qty{140}{m/s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:charges-currents-conduction:5}", "(a) 电流流入而无流出：$\\dd Q/\\dd t = I$。(b) 电荷累积：$\\partial_t", "\\rho \\ne 0$。(c) $\\vect j = (I/4\\pi r^2)\\vect e_r$：$\\operatorname{div}\\vect j = \\frac1{r^2}", "\\partial_r(I/4\\pi) = 0$。(d) 仅在电极处成立，此处电流", "由导线注入 --- 是通量的一个源。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:charges-currents-conduction:6}", "(a) $j = I/2\\pi rL$，$E = j/\\gamma$，沿径向。(b) $U = \\int_a^bE\\,\\dd r = I\\ln(b/a)/", "2\\pi\\gamma L$：$R = \\ln3.5/(2\\pi \\times 10^{-13} \\times 10^3) = \\qty{2e9}{\\ohm}$ 每千米。", "(c) \\qty{0.5}{\\micro A}，\\qty{0.5}{mW}。(d) $RC = \\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon_r/\\gamma = \\qty{200}{s}$（取", "$\\varepsilon_r = 2.3$）：带电并与外界隔离的电缆，通过其自身的绝缘体放电，", "放电时间尺度即该绝缘体的弛豫时间。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:charges-currents-conduction:7}", "(a) $\\omega\\tau$：$8 \\times 10^{-12}$、$1.6 \\times 10^{-3}$、$4.7$、$79$。(b) $|\\underline\\gamma|/\\gamma_0 =", "1/\\sqrt{1 + \\omega^2\\tau^2}$：$1$、$1$、$0.21$、$0.013$；相位 $-\\arctan\\omega\\tau$：$0$、", "$-\\qty{0.09}{\\degree}$、$-\\qty{78}{\\degree}$、$-\\qty{89}{\\degree}$。(c) $\\omega\\tau \\le 0.14$：$f \\le", "\\qty{0.9}{THz}$。(d) $\\underline\\gamma \\approx ne^2/\\iu m\\omega$：$\\underline{\\vect j}$ 相对", "$\\underline{\\vect E}$ 落后 \\qty{90}{\\degree}，$\\langle\\vect j\\cdot\\vect E\\rangle = 0$：没有焦耳", "热 --- 电子像在等离子体中那样自由振荡。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:charges-currents-conduction:8}", "(a) $S = \\qty{3.1e-8}{m^2}$，$j = \\qty{3.2e8}{A/m^2}$，$p = j^2/\\gamma = \\qty{1.7e9}{W/m^3}$。", "(b) 单位体积熔化所需能量 $\\rho(c\\Delta T + L_f) = 8900(4.1 \\times 10^5 + 2.05 \\times", "10^5) = \\qty{5.5e9}{J/m^3}$：\\qty{3.2}{s}。(c) 快九倍：\\qty{0.36}{s}。(d) 额定电流", "是这样一个电流：其焦耳热恰好被空气带走，", "使温度保持在熔点以下；沙子用来熄灭电弧，", "否则导线熔断后，电弧会跨越间隙继续导电。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:charges-currents-conduction:9}", "(a) $\\partial_t\\rho = -\\operatorname{div}\\vect j = -\\gamma\\operatorname{div}\\vect E = -\\gamma\\rho/", "\\varepsilon_0$。(b) $\\varepsilon_0/\\gamma$：\\qty{1.5e-19}{s}、\\qty{1.8e-12}{s}、\\qty{1.8e-10}{s}、", "\\qty{9}{s}、$9 \\times 10^4$ s。(c) $f \\lesssim 1/2\\pi\\tau_r$：$10^{18}$ Hz（德鲁德模型", "早在此之前就已失效）、\\qty{90}{GHz}、\\qty{0.9}{GHz}、\\qty{0.02}{Hz}、\\qty{2e-6}{Hz}。(d)", "玻璃棒若通过其体积导电，一分钟内就会失去电荷；", "真实干燥玻璃的电导率更接近 $10^{-14}$ S/m（需数小时），通常是表面", "湿度使其放电 --- 在数量", "级上相符。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:charges-currents-conduction:10}", "(a) $\\vect j = (I/2\\pi r^2)\\vect e_r$，$E = I/2\\pi\\gamma r^2$，$V = I/2\\pi\\gamma r$。(b) $R = V(a)", "/I = 1/2\\pi\\gamma a = \\qty{32}{\\ohm}$。(c) $V_{\\text{rod}} = \\qty{640}{kV}$；$V(10) = \\qty{32}{kV}$，", "$V(10.7) = \\qty{30}{kV}$：两脚之间为 \\qty{2.1}{kV}。(d) 前", "腿与后腿沿半径方向相距 \\qty{1.5}{m}：$4$--\\qty{5}{kV}，且", "电流路径穿过心脏。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:charges-currents-conduction:11}", "(a) $E_H = jB/nq$，其中 $j = I/wt$：$V_H = E_Hw = IB/nqt$。(b) $1/(8.5 \\times 10^{28}", "\\times 1.6 \\times 10^{-19} \\times 10^{-4}) = \\qty{0.7}{\\micro V}$。(c) \\qty{6.3}{mV}：$V_H \\propto 1/n$，", "而半导体的载流子数少 $10^6$ 倍。(d) $B = V_Hnqt/I =", "10^{-5} \\times 10^{22} \\times 1.6 \\times 10^{-19} \\times 2 \\times 10^{-5}/10^{-3} = \\qty{0.32}{T}$；由", "$V_H$ 的符号可得载流子的符号（对已知的 $\\vect B$），或由", "$\\vect B$ 的方向（对已知的传感器）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:charges-currents-conduction:12}", "(a) $\\vect j = ne\\mu_+\\vect E + (-ne)(-\\mu_-\\vect E)$：两种粒子", "沿相反方向漂移，却沿同一方向输运电流。(b) $n =", "0.5 \\times 10^3 \\times 6.02 \\times 10^{23} = \\qty{3e26}{m^{-3}}$：$\\gamma = 3 \\times 10^{26} \\times 1.6 \\times 10^{-19}", "\\times 1.31 \\times 10^{-7} = \\qty{6.3}{S/m}$（离子在此浓度下相互", "阻碍，实测为 \\qty{5}{S/m}）。(c) \\qty{0.52}{\\micro m/s} 与 \\qty{0.79}{\\micro m/s}：", "Cl$^-$ 携带 $60\\%$ 的电流。(d) $R = L/\\gamma S = \\qty{200}{\\ohm}$，$U = \\qty{200}{V}$，$P =", "\\qty{200}{W}$ 注入 \\qty{10}{g} 水中：\\qty{2}{s} 内升温 \\qty{10}{K} --- 因此电泳槽", "需配冷却极板。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:charges-currents-conduction:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $n = \\rho N_A/M = \\qty{8.4e28}{m^{-3}}$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $j = \\qty{6.4e6}{A/m^2}$，$v = j/ne = \\qty{0.47}{mm/s}$；每米需 \\qty{35}{min}。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $\\tau = m\\gamma/ne^2 = \\qty{2.5e-14}{s}$，$\\mu = \\qty{4.4e-3}{m^2/(V.s)}$，$\\ell =", "\\qty{40}{nm}$，$150$ 个间距：电子与缺陷及", "热振动发生碰撞，而非与原子碰撞。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $\\rho_e \\propto T$ 给出 $\\alpha = 1/293 = \\qty{3.4e-3}{K^{-1}}$，与", "实测值 $4 \\times 10^{-3}$ 接近。", ""]}